# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
# Unanchored on purpose. Flutter's template ships `/build/`, which only matches
# the repo root — so `packages/mom_engine/build/` (created by `flutter test` in
# that package) was being tracked, including a 4MB .dill cache that churned on
# every test run. This form matches build/ at any depth.
build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
